* NMOS Id-Vd
* Execute `make check` in bsim directory to run tests
* nmos/pmos transistor model and modelcards are loaded dynamically,
* which allows us to run tests with different model versions or models

verilog

ground \0 ;

vsource #(.dc(vd)) sd(d , \0 );
vsource #(.dc(vg)) sg(g , \0 );
vsource #(.dc(vs)) sb(s , \0 );
vsource #(.dc(vb)) sb(b , \0 );

parameter vd = 0.0;
parameter vg = 0.0;
parameter vs = 0.0;
parameter vb = 0.0;

N1 #(.l(0.09u), .w(10.0u), .nf(5)) M1(.d(d), .g(g), .s(s), .b(b));

list
print dc v(g) i(sd) iter(0)
dc vd 0 1.2 0.02 vg 0.2 1.2 0.2 basic
status notime
